[500.780247, "o", "[Profiling] Using timing method: cuda_event\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 30\r\ncopy ms: 0.182\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 30\r\nS=64 VEC=8192 w=8: ok=True diff=3.46e-06 mean=0.352 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 30\r\nS=128 VEC=8192 w=8: ok=True diff=3.46e-06 mean=0.383 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 30\r\nS=128 VEC=8192 w=16: ok=True diff=3.46e-06 mean=0.399 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 30\r\nS=128 VEC=4096 w=4: ok=True diff=3.46e-06 mean=0.353 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 30\r\nS=256 VEC=8192 w=8: ok=True diff=3.10e-06 mean=0.407 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 30\r\nS=128 VEC=16384 w=16: ok=True diff=3.46e-06 mean=0.44 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 30\r\nS=64 VEC=409"]
[500.780306, "o", "6 w=4: ok=True diff=3.46e-06 mean=0.337 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 30\r\nS=256 VEC=4096 w=8: ok=True diff=3.10e-06 mean=0.395 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 30\r\nS=512 VEC=8192 w=8: ok=True diff=3.10e-06 mean=0.441 ms\r\n"]
