[923.697208, "o", "[Profiling] Using timing method: cuda_event\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=128 w=32: bad=191/200 worst=2.35e+01 mean=0.203 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=128 w=16: bad=157/200 worst=6.49e+01 mean=0.202 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=256 w=16: bad=200/200 worst=1.80e+01 mean=0.194 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=256 w=32: bad=200/200 worst=3.39e+01 mean=0.193 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=64 w=16: bad=188/200 worst=5.38e+01 mean=0.235 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=512 w=16: bad=194/200 worst=5.95e+01 mean=0.201 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=128 w=8: bad=198/200 worst=4.39e+01 mean=0.214 ms\r\n"]
