[1105.903389, "o", "[Profiling] Using timing method: cuda_event\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=128 w=32 ns=0: bad=0/200 worst=5.13e-06 mean=0.254 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=128 w=32 ns=128: bad=0/200 worst=5.13e-06 mean=0.254 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=128 w=32 ns=512: bad=0/200 worst=6.20e-06 mean=0.259 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=256 w=16 ns=256: bad=0/200 worst=8.23e-06 mean=0.257 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=256 w=16 ns=512: bad=0/200 worst=8.58e-06 mean=0.259 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=512 w=8 ns=256: bad=0/200 worst=9.89e-06 mean=0.258 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=256 w=8 ns=256: bad=0/200 worst=8.46e-06 mean=0.259 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA "]
[1105.903437, "o", "H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=128 w=16 ns=256: bad=0/200 worst=6.08e-06 mean=0.252 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=512 w=16 ns=256: bad=0/200 worst=9.42e-06 mean=0.26 ms\r\n"]
