[1428.215176, "o", "[Profiling] Using timing method: cuda_event\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=128 w=32: bad=1000/1000 worst_rel=0.00e+00 mean=0.2 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=256 w=16: bad=1000/1000 worst_rel=0.00e+00 mean=0.212 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=128 w=16: bad=1000/1000 worst_rel=0.00e+00 mean=0.191 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=512 w=16: bad=1000/1000 worst_rel=0.00e+00 mean=0.264 ms\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 50\r\nS=256 w=32: bad=1000/1000 worst_rel=0.00e+00 mean=0.24 ms\r\nfsum tensor([2097614.2500, 1398257.6250, 2096607.5000, 1397546.1250],\r\n       device='cuda:0')\r\ncnt tensor([128, 128, 128, 128], device='cuda:0', dtype=torch.int32)\r\ny[0,0,0,:4] tensor([ 0.4258, -1.8492, -0.3838, -1.7351], device='cuda:0')\r\nref[0,0,0,:4] tensor([ 0.3911, -1.6982, -0.3524, -1.5934], de"]
